<section class="reality">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="reality__content">

            <!-- left -->
            <div class="reality__left">
                
                <span class="reality__subtitle">
                    Realities of Indonesian Designers
                </span>

                <h3 class="reality__title">
                    How many great designs are still sitting on your laptop?
                </h3>

            </div>

            <!-- right -->
            <div class="reality__right">

                <p class="reality__text">
                    We know the reality. Indonesia is home to countless talented designers, creative students, and skilled artisans with extraordinary ideas. Yet too often, those ideas remain unrealized due to limited resources, industry access, and production opportunities.
                </p>

                <p class="reality__text">
                    Meanwhile, on the international stage, exceptional work from local designers is often sold without recognition — treated as a mass-produced product rather than a creation with a name and a story behind it.
                </p>

                <div class="reality__highlight">

                    <p class="reality__highlight-text">
                        This is untapped potential that has been overlooked for far too long. But that story ends here.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <p class="reality__text">
                    The Woodara Indonesian Design Contest is more than just a competition. It is a turning point — a platform built for those who believe in the power of their ideas and the future of their designs.
                </p>

                <p class="reality__text">
                    We don't care how small your studio is. We are looking for real <span>PASSION</span> and <span>TALENT</span>. We are ready to identify the strongest ideas, bring <span>5 selected furniture collections</span> (Indoor & Outdoor) to leading manufacturing partners, and introduce them to the <span>global market worldwide.</span>
                </p>


            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

